---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout 
	title="老叶刚需网络指南 - 解决 ChatGPT 封号、TikTok 黑屏、外服游戏卡顿难题"
	description="老叶独家撰写！非普通翻墙教程。深度剖析 ChatGPT Access Denied、TikTok 零播放量以及 PS5/PC 联机游戏卡顿的网络底层原因，并给出彻底的节点破局方案。"
>
	<main class="flex-1 bg-slate-50 pb-24">
		<!-- Hero Section -->
		<section class="bg-white border-b border-slate-200 py-16">
			<div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 text-center">
				<h1 class="text-3xl font-extrabold text-slate-900 sm:text-5xl tracking-tight">
					老叶<span class="text-indigo-600">刚需网络</span>指南
				</h1>
				<p class="mt-4 text-lg text-slate-600 max-w-2xl mx-auto">
					别拿垃圾节点考验大厂的风控！这里不聊虚的测速，只解决让你头疼的“三大刚需痛点”：AI 封号、出海搞钱死号、外服打机丢包。老叶手把手带你破局。
				</p>
			</div>
		</section>

		<!-- Content Section -->
		<section class="max-w-5xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 py-12">
			
			<div class="grid lg:grid-cols-3 gap-8">
				
				<!-- ChatGPT Card -->
				<a href="/guides/chatgpt-network-error" class="group flex flex-col bg-white rounded-3xl p-8 shadow-sm ring-1 ring-slate-200 transition-all hover:shadow-xl hover:ring-indigo-500 relative overflow-hidden">
					<div class="absolute -right-4 -top-4 w-24 h-24 bg-teal-50 rounded-full group-hover:scale-150 transition-transform duration-500 ease-out z-0"></div>
					<div class="relative z-10">
						<div class="w-16 h-16 bg-teal-100 text-teal-600 rounded-2xl flex items-center justify-center mb-6">
							<svg class="w-8 h-8" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M9.75 17L9 20l-1 1h8l-1-1-.75-3M3 13h18M5 17h14a2 2 0 002-2V5a2 2 0 00-2-2H5a2 2 0 00-2 2v10a2 2 0 002 2z" /></svg>
						</div>
						<div class="flex gap-2 mb-3">
							<span class="text-xs font-bold px-2.5 py-1 bg-slate-100 text-slate-600 rounded-full">AI 专区</span>
							<span class="text-xs font-bold px-2.5 py-1 bg-rose-100 text-rose-700 rounded-full">高危风控</span>
						</div>
						<h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-slate-900 group-hover:text-indigo-600 transition-colors mb-3">ChatGPT 频繁封号、Access Denied 怎么办？</h2>
						<p class="text-sm text-slate-600 leading-relaxed mb-6">
							别以为连上外网就能用 AI。老叶为你深扒 OpenAI 的 IP 封锁机制，揭秘“万人骑节点”的危害，教你如何辨别真正的全解锁原生 IP。
						</p>
						<div class="mt-auto flex items-center text-indigo-600 font-semibold text-sm">
							阅读破局指南 <svg class="w-4 h-4 ml-1 group-hover:translate-x-1 transition-transform" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M9 5l7 7-7 7" /></svg>
						</div>
					</div>
				</a>

				<!-- TikTok Card -->
				<a href="/guides/tiktok-zero-views" class="group flex flex-col bg-white rounded-3xl p-8 shadow-sm ring-1 ring-slate-200 transition-all hover:shadow-xl hover:ring-indigo-500 relative overflow-hidden">
					<div class="absolute -right-4 -top-4 w-24 h-24 bg-pink-50 rounded-full group-hover:scale-150 transition-transform duration-500 ease-out z-0"></div>
					<div class="relative z-10">
						<div class="w-16 h-16 bg-pink-100 text-pink-600 rounded-2xl flex items-center justify-center mb-6">
							<svg class="w-8 h-8" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M21 12a9 9 0 01-9 9m9-9a9 9 0 00-9-9m9 9H3m9 9a9 9 0 01-9-9m9 9c1.657 0 3-4.03 3-9s-1.343-9-3-9m0 18c-1.657 0-3-4.03-3-9s1.343-9 3-9m-9 9a9 9 0 019-9" /></svg>
						</div>
						<div class="flex gap-2 mb-3">
							<span class="text-xs font-bold px-2.5 py-1 bg-slate-100 text-slate-600 rounded-full">跨境出海</span>
							<span class="text-xs font-bold px-2.5 py-1 bg-amber-100 text-amber-700 rounded-full">搞钱必备</span>
						</div>
						<h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-slate-900 group-hover:text-indigo-600 transition-colors mb-3">TikTok 零播放黑屏？外贸网络防坑终极揭秘</h2>
						<p class="text-sm text-slate-600 leading-relaxed mb-6">
							你以为拔了电话卡、改了时区就能做 TikTok？大错特错！老叶教你搞懂“伪装度”和“DNS泄露”，推荐真正的独享原生宽带方案。
						</p>
						<div class="mt-auto flex items-center text-indigo-600 font-semibold text-sm">
							阅读破局指南 <svg class="w-4 h-4 ml-1 group-hover:translate-x-1 transition-transform" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M9 5l7 7-7 7" /></svg>
						</div>
					</div>
				</a>

				<!-- Gaming Card -->
				<a href="/guides/gaming-proxy" class="group flex flex-col bg-white rounded-3xl p-8 shadow-sm ring-1 ring-slate-200 transition-all hover:shadow-xl hover:ring-indigo-500 relative overflow-hidden">
					<div class="absolute -right-4 -top-4 w-24 h-24 bg-amber-50 rounded-full group-hover:scale-150 transition-transform duration-500 ease-out z-0"></div>
					<div class="relative z-10">
						<div class="w-16 h-16 bg-amber-100 text-amber-600 rounded-2xl flex items-center justify-center mb-6">
							<svg class="w-8 h-8" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M14.752 11.168l-3.197-2.132A1 1 0 0010 9.87v4.263a1 1 0 001.555.832l3.197-2.132a1 1 0 000-1.664z" /><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M21 12a9 9 0 11-18 0 9 9 0 0118 0z" /></svg>
						</div>
						<div class="flex gap-2 mb-3">
							<span class="text-xs font-bold px-2.5 py-1 bg-slate-100 text-slate-600 rounded-full">电竞主机</span>
							<span class="text-xs font-bold px-2.5 py-1 bg-emerald-100 text-emerald-700 rounded-full">超低延迟</span>
						</div>
						<h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-slate-900 group-hover:text-indigo-600 transition-colors mb-3">不买硬件路由，机场节点怎么给 PS5 / 电脑打游戏加速？</h2>
						<p class="text-sm text-slate-600 leading-relaxed mb-6">
							机场能代替 UU 加速器吗？老叶为你拆解 TCP 与 UDP 转发的玄学。手把手教你零成本用电脑把高级 IEPL 专线共享给主机联机。
						</p>
						<div class="mt-auto flex items-center text-indigo-600 font-semibold text-sm">
							阅读破局指南 <svg class="w-4 h-4 ml-1 group-hover:translate-x-1 transition-transform" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M9 5l7 7-7 7" /></svg>
						</div>
					</div>
				</a>

				<!-- Netflix Streaming Card -->
				<a href="/netflix-streaming" class="group flex flex-col bg-white rounded-3xl p-8 shadow-sm ring-1 ring-slate-200 transition-all hover:shadow-xl hover:ring-indigo-500 relative overflow-hidden">
					<div class="absolute -right-4 -top-4 w-24 h-24 bg-red-50 rounded-full group-hover:scale-150 transition-transform duration-500 ease-out z-0"></div>
					<div class="relative z-10">
						<div class="w-16 h-16 bg-red-100 text-red-600 rounded-2xl flex items-center justify-center mb-6">
							<svg class="w-8 h-8" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M15 10l4.553-2.276A1 1 0 0121 8.618v6.764a1 1 0 01-1.447.894L15 14M5 18h8a2 2 0 002-2V8a2 2 0 00-2-2H5a2 2 0 00-2 2v8a2 2 0 002 2z" /></svg>
						</div>
						<div class="flex gap-2 mb-3">
							<span class="text-xs font-bold px-2.5 py-1 bg-slate-100 text-slate-600 rounded-full">影音追剧</span>
							<span class="text-xs font-bold px-2.5 py-1 bg-red-100 text-red-700 rounded-full">完美解锁</span>
						</div>
						<h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-slate-900 group-hover:text-indigo-600 transition-colors mb-3">Netflix / Disney+ 流媒体解锁完全指南</h2>
						<p class="text-sm text-slate-600 leading-relaxed mb-6">
							受够了看剧时突然弹出的“您似乎使用了代理解锁器”？老叶教你怎么查原生 IP，并提供 100% 稳定解锁 Netflix 等流媒体的高端机场榜单。
						</p>
						<div class="mt-auto flex items-center text-indigo-600 font-semibold text-sm">
							查看流媒体榜单 <svg class="w-4 h-4 ml-1 group-hover:translate-x-1 transition-transform" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M9 5l7 7-7 7" /></svg>
						</div>
					</div>
				</a>

				<!-- FAQ Card -->
				<a href="/faq" class="group flex flex-col bg-white rounded-3xl p-8 shadow-sm ring-1 ring-slate-200 transition-all hover:shadow-xl hover:ring-indigo-500 relative overflow-hidden">
					<div class="absolute -right-4 -top-4 w-24 h-24 bg-blue-50 rounded-full group-hover:scale-150 transition-transform duration-500 ease-out z-0"></div>
					<div class="relative z-10">
						<div class="w-16 h-16 bg-blue-100 text-blue-600 rounded-2xl flex items-center justify-center mb-6">
							<svg class="w-8 h-8" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M8.228 9c.549-1.165 2.03-2 3.772-2 2.21 0 4 1.343 4 3 0 1.4-1.278 2.575-3.006 2.907-.542.104-.994.54-.994 1.093m0 3h.01M21 12a9 9 0 11-18 0 9 9 0 0118 0z" /></svg>
						</div>
						<div class="flex gap-2 mb-3">
							<span class="text-xs font-bold px-2.5 py-1 bg-slate-100 text-slate-600 rounded-full">新手必看</span>
							<span class="text-xs font-bold px-2.5 py-1 bg-blue-100 text-blue-700 rounded-full">百问百答</span>
						</div>
						<h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-slate-900 group-hover:text-indigo-600 transition-colors mb-3">科学上网“百问百答”疑难杂症全收录</h2>
						<p class="text-sm text-slate-600 leading-relaxed mb-6">
							什么是 IPLC？什么是中转？节点超时怎么办？为什么刚买的套餐连不上？这里收录了小白翻墙路上可能遇到的所有问题，包教包会。
						</p>
						<div class="mt-auto flex items-center text-indigo-600 font-semibold text-sm">
							进入问题库查阅 <svg class="w-4 h-4 ml-1 group-hover:translate-x-1 transition-transform" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M9 5l7 7-7 7" /></svg>
						</div>
					</div>
				</a>

			</div>
		</section>
	</main>
</Layout>
